      "label": "Incomes (interval) among those who work after higher education. Graduation year 1996/1997-2018/2019",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2022-03-30T06:00:00Z",
      "link": {
        "related": [
          {
            "extension": {
              "relation": "statistics-homepage",
              "metaid": "PRODUCTCODE:UF0503"
